- loading_container_loaded loading_container_beta (need to load)
- loading_container_leg_linked loading_container_beta transport_leg_alpha (goal requires this)
- candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha (we will set)
- not origin_leg_loaded transport_leg_alpha (so origin leg not loaded)
- not candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_beta (init false)

Thus we need to load loading_container_beta onto transport_leg_alpha, and link it.

Loading container loaded and leg linked can be done via load_container_onto_leg action.

Action load_container_onto_leg:

(:action load_container_onto_leg
    :parameters (?candidate - schedule_candidate ?loading_container - loading_container ?transport_leg - transport_leg)
    :precondition
      (and
        (candidate_prepared ?candidate)
        (candidate_transport_leg_linked ?candidate ?transport_leg)
        (candidate_loading_container_linked ?candidate ?loading_container)
        (loading_container_available ?loading_container)
        (transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg)
        (transport_leg_loading_authorized ?transport_leg)
        (not
          (loading_container_loaded ?loading_container)
        )
      )
    :effect
      (and
        (loading_container_loaded ?loading_container)
        (loading_container_leg_linked ?loading_container ?transport_leg)
        (not
          (loading_container_available ?loading_container)
        )
      )
)

Thus we need candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta, candidate_transport_leg_linked shift_candidate_beta transport_leg_alpha (already true from init), candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta (true), loading_container_available loading_container_beta (init true), transport_leg_assembled transport_leg_alpha (need to achieve), transport_leg_loading_authorized transport_leg_alpha (need to achieve), and not loading_container_loaded (init false). After action, we get loading_container_loaded and loading_container_leg_linked, and loading_container_available false.

